<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Stability and Safety Governed Memory (SSGM): Design Principles and Research Agenda ‣ Governing Evolving Memory in LLM Agents: Risks, Mechanisms, and theStability and Safety Governed Memory (SSGM) Framework" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Formalizing the SSGM Framework</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Stability and Safety Governed Memory (SSGM): Design Principles and Research Agenda ‣ Governing Evolving Memory in LLM Agents: Risks, Mechanisms, and theStability and Safety Governed Memory (SSGM) Framework" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Testable Research Hypotheses and Evaluation Protocols</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
