<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Y. Gao, Y. Xiong, X. Gao, K. Jia, J. Pan, Y. Bi, Y. Dai, J. Sun, H. Wang, and H. Wang</span>
